effect:
These tools have 6 uses when fully stocked. Whenever you would spend _Supplies_ for the _Patch_ _Camp Action_ you may roll a d6. If you roll less than or equal to the number of uses remaining, spend one use instead of _Supplies_. Otherwise, you must spend _Supplies_ as normal for _Patch_.
&nbsp;
Characters capable of using these Tools or another appropriate one (such as _Herbalism Tools_) can, as a _Camp Action_, restore 2 uses for the cost of appropriate _Supplies_. In a town, characters can typically replenish all uses for the price of a single Supply.
&nbsp;
When characters without the appropriate training use Physician's Tools they instead spend 3 uses after successfully replacing _Supplies_.
